Original commit body from b2fb797:

Symbol mention centrality now uses only parallelized Python regex.
Ripgrep was removed because:
- Symbol names with special regex characters caused parse errors
- The Python path is fast enough (O(files) with combined alternation)
- Only ~0.1% of repos (30k+ symbols) would benefit from ripgrep

Changes:
- Remove _is_ripgrep_available() and _compute_centrality_with_ripgrep()
- Simplify compute_symbol_mention_centrality_batch() to call Python directly
- Remove ripgrep installation instructions from README and CONTRIBUTING
- Update ADR-0005 to reflect current implementation
- Add future work note in spec about potential ripgrep optimization
